      "side": 1,
      "message": "The root cause is\n1.EC won\u0027t enter pre-charge due to we can get battery information.\n2.EC won\u0027t enter normal charge due to report BP_NO when we get BATTERY_NOT_DISCONNECTED here.\n3.Can\u0027t do any charge to battery cause battery never release discharge_fet.\n\nWe still need to keep this way to detect battery connectivity for prevent_power_on.\nAnd the best solution is to report BP_NOT_SURE for doing charge function to releae discharget_fet and keep prevent_power_on work.\n\nAlso I think it reasonable to report BP_NOT_SURE in this case.\nWe can recognize battery from HW and also can get battery information from gauge.\nBut battery show can\u0027t discharge, so report BP_NOT_SURE for keep trying to charge battery and also prevent power drop when battery can\u0027t support discharge due to power on.\n\nYou can this CL for this fix\u0027s detail.\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/346368",
